# MONTHEND.MEM -- the memory variables of the March month-end close, saved
# with SAVE TO MONTHEND (Using InitechBase, RESTORE).  The dBASE III PLUS
# memory file (dbase3-decomp specs/file-formats/mem.md); MRATE has the width
# and decimals of a literal with two decimal places (CHKBOOK.MEM BALANCE,
# mem.md Sec 5).
MEMORY MONTHEND.MEM
VAR MCLERK C PRUITT
VAR MRATE N 13 2 1.5
VAR MCUTOFF D 19920331
VAR MPOSTED L F
